    "text": "Your flight has been booked. You will be flying on SA257 from SKA to SKE on 2026-12-07. The departure time is 06:15 and the arrival time is 08:20. The fare is Saver, priced at $79 per passenger. There is a change fee of $50 if you need to make any changes. This booking is not refundable.\n\nWould you like to confirm this booking?",
