    "text": "Great! Your booking for flight SA257 from SKA to SKE on 2026-12-07 is confirmed. The fare is Saver at $79 per passenger, and there is a change fee of $50 if needed. This booking is not refundable.\n\nIf you have any other questions or need further assistance, feel free to ask!",
